Parts of this directory come from objc2 (https://github.com/madsmtm/objc2):
the files in patches/ carry objc2's hand-written source, as context and as
the changes from Sidestep's objc2 fork, and src/platform.rs ports
header-translator's src/cfgs.rs with its unit tests.

